sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Publisher
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant A as Ops API
  participant R as Registry
  participant Q as SQS
  participant W as Worker
  participant D as Engagement system
  participant U as UI
  P->>G: POST /admin/publishes
  G->>A: key ok, within throttle
  A->>R: engagements on older versions
  A->>Q: batch send jobs
  A-->>P: 202 offerId, enqueued
  Q->>W: receive up to free permits
  W->>R: conditional put (idempotency)
  W->>D: load (about 1 min, permit held)
  D-->>W: ok
  W->>R: pending flag done
  U->>A: GET engagement status
  A-->>U: pending badge + summary
